 this ? <br /> <br /> <b>Pierce the deception (Prime \u2022\u2022)<br /> Practice : Ruling<br /> Primary factor : Duration<br /> Suggestd skill rote : Investigation, Empathy, Subterfuge</b><br /> By tunning her mind to the higher truth of the supernal, the mage can sense disturbance and telltale signs of lies in the mundane language, she can sense when someone is directly lying to her<br /> <br /> <b>+1 reach and one mana :</b> the mage can invoke a bit of the supernal in his mind and get the informed condition relating to decyphering the truth behind the falsehood for a number of lies equal to the spell potency<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Pierce Deception is already a one dot spell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T15:20:35-07:00","id":1209420,"title":"","content":"Darnit ! I just want a spell that can make use of the informed condition D:, i swear i will get this one day !","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12946-emerick","name":"Emerick","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12946_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T18:20:00-07:00","id":1209465,"title":"","content":"I'm sure this one will be at least passable <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> !<br /> <br /> <b>Know thy tool (Prime \u2022\u2022/Spirit \u2022\u2022)<br /> Practice : Rulling<br /> Primary factor : Duration<br /> Wisthood by : Rank<br /> Suggester rotes skills : Investigation, occult , empathy</b><br /> Prime is the realm of truth, resonance and revaltion, but by reading both the resonance and the essence of spirit being inhabiting he innanimate and gaining its cooperation<br /> the mage can pick and object and knows it innermost nature and workings and gains the informed condition relating to the use of the object<br /> <b>+1 reach </b>if the mage doesn't have any dots in the skill required to use the object (such as a scapel for medecine) the mage gains a bonus dice equal to the potency of the spell (this bonus does not negate the penalty for not having said skill)<br /> <b>+1 reach</b> If the object is a weapon, the mage instead gains a weapon modifier, if it's an armor, the mage lessen the penalty to speed or defense equal to the spell potency","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":12946,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12946-emerick","user":"Emerick","date":".  Bad grammar 04-20-2018, 09:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12946-emerick","name":"Emerick","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12946_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T18:34:33-07:00","id":1209468,"title":"","content":"This would be more appropriate as a Matter spell. I'm pretty sure Prime can't do it at all. Spirit might be able to accomplish something similar, but I think it would be by tapping into an object's spirit and getting it to use its Strengthen Influence on the object it's attached to.<br /> <br /> Besides, just get Prime 3 and use Platonic Form if you want the Prime version.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T18:41:46-07:00","id":1209471,"title":"","content":"It's not really wanting a platonic object, it's more like reading the resonance of the object, the supernal truth assiociated with it and coaxing the spirit into helping you manipulate it, and yeah i guess it could be achieved with a matter spell , but revelation is a purview of prime and reaching to a spirit to force it to help you should be fine, and as they say in the book <br /> Just because a Fate \u2022\u2022\u2022 spell can do a<br /> thing doesn\u2019t mean a Forces \u2022 spell that does a<br /> similar thing is \u201cbroken\u201d or should be disallowed<br /> ...right ? D:","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12946-emerick","name":"Emerick","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12946_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T18:44:25-07:00","id":1209472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Emerick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/877640-creative-thaumaturgy-fallen-world-edition?p=1209465#post1209465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sure this one will be at least passable <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> !<br /> <br /> <b>Know thy tool (Prime \u2022\u2022/Spirit \u2022\u2022)<br /> Practice : Rulling<br /> Primary factor : Duration<br /> Wisthood by : Rank<br /> Suggester rotes skills : Investigation, occult , empathy</b><br /> Prime is the realm of truth, resonance and revaltion, but by reading both the resonance and the essence of spirit being inhabiting he innanimate and gaining its cooperation<br /> the mage can pick and object and knows it innermost nature and workings and gains the informed condition relating to the use of the object<br /> <b>+1 reach </b>if the mage doesn't have any dots in the skill required to use the object (such as a scapel for medecine) the mage gains a bonus dice equal to the potency of the spell (this bonus does not negate the penalty for not having said skill)<br /> <b>+1 reach</b> If the object is a weapon, the mage instead gains a weapon modifier, if it's an armor, the mage lessen the penalty to speed or defense equal to the spell potency</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this should be Prime or Spirit, not both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"ht